---
import { Monitor, Share2, Smartphone, Terminal, Apple, ShieldAlert, TrendingUp, DollarSign } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="iot-platform" class="py-24 bg-dark-900 border-t border-white/5 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-amber/10 border border-brand-amber/20 text-xs font-mono text-brand-amber mb-4">
        <span>COMMERCIAL PLATFORM 01</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        钧曦物联网 MDM 分销平台
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-amber font-medium mb-4">
        全平台设备统一纳管 ＋ 自动化多级分润商业中台
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base leading-relaxed">
        打通工业物联网设备全生命周期纳管与商业裂变变现闭环。原生支持全端操作系统深度管控，内置防穿透佣金计算与资金流对账结算引擎，让硬件网络成为自动化收益流转的现金流基座。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 OS Platforms + PMS Distribution Engine -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-12">
      <!-- 4 OS Platform Cards (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <!-- Android -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-850 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-amber/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-green-500/10 border border-green-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-green-400 mb-4">
            <Smartphone class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Android MDM</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <li>• Kiosk 展厅与工控全屏锁定</li>
            <li>• 应用静默分发、升级与卸载</li>
            <li>• 远程低延迟桌面镜像控制</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Windows -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-850 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-amber/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-4">
            <Monitor class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Windows 控制台</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <li>• 企业端系统安全补丁统一下发</li>
            <li>• 终端软件资产全自动实时盘点</li>
            <li>• 外设接入限制与合规策略管控</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Linux / IoT -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-850 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-amber/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 mb-4">
            <Terminal class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Linux / 边缘容器</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <li>• 远程安全加密 Shell 调试通道</li>
            <li>• 边缘 Docker 容器化业务下发</li>
            <li>• 遥测心跳与系统资源持续监视</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Apple -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-dark-850 border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-amber/30 transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-slate-200/10 border border-slate-200/30 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-200 mb-4">
            <Apple class="w-5 h-5" />
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Apple 设备合规</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">
            <li>• MDM Profile 配置文件远程签名</li>
            <li>• 企业级开发证书应用合规分发</li>
            <li>• 遗失定位与远程擦除防护</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PMS Distribution Engine (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-850 to-amber-950/20 border border-brand-amber/30 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-amber/10 border border-brand-amber/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-amber mb-6">
            <Share2 class="w-6 h-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-amber mb-2">PMS 自动化多级分润引擎</div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">商业收益秒级清分对账</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            内置成熟的渠道合伙人分级、设备阶梯分成体系。交易事件触发不可变账本实时写入，杜绝数据篡改与利益穿透。
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-dark-900/60 border border-white/5">
              <DollarSign class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-amber" />
              <span>动态费率：16% 渠道分润与阶梯裂变</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-dark-900/60 border border-white/5">
              <TrendingUp class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-amber" />
              <span>T+1 / 月结风控与自动化提现门禁审核</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <span>落地案例：国家级高新园区</span>
          <span class="text-brand-amber font-bold">+92% 结算提速</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
